      "basis": "Camera capture: the 0x5c0-byte stage-2 block the kernel copies to 0x7f4fc, read over ff80 in a service-mode power-on (X-T20 2.11, 2026-10-20; SHA-256 d7cca82d81be252c32012d9392b6f9143a5729d52bd04f21c2a90c1c54e54cca). +0x00 holds the 16 power-on GPIO input words and +0x140 the sub-CPU power-on cause 0x10, which section 5 decodes as a normal start. Placed in a free RAM gap; kernel entry bypasses the boot ROM and stage 2."
